    description: "Work out photography session cost beyond shoot hours, including editing, travel, assistant fees and delivery capacity, with complete examples.",
    metaDescription: "Price a photography session using shoot, editing, travel and delivery time. Calculate contribution and the bookings your schedule can actually fulfill.",
